contentText:
JISOO knows that all eyes are on her as she gets ready to release her debut solo album. And in a new interview with V Magazine published Wednesday (May 6), the BLACKPINK singer opened up about what fans can look forward to on her first full-length and how she deals with the pressure of their high expectations for her.

